{
  "id": "RAW_e634d9d2a8",
  "title": "以免费一年的 Gemini 开启新学期",
  "url": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-app/student-offer-google-ai/",
  "date": "2026-08-20 03:28:01",
  "author": "Jennifer Shen",
  "siteName": "The Keyword (blog.google) ",
  "content": "<!--article text-->\n<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"279qf\">The beginning of a new college year is always filled with anticipation — new classes, professors, and the promise of a fresh start. To help get you started, Google is offering student plans for one year at no cost and launching new and enhanced study tools.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"2p1k9\">Here are five steps you can take to make the most of this school year with the help of Gemini.</p>\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"2j1qt\">1. Sign up for your 12-month student plan, free of charge.</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"ahe9j\">Starting today, we’re introducing new offers on our Google AI plans so that college students heading back to campus can unlock more of Gemini.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"eftdj\">For eligible college students in the U.S., we’re offering one year of Google AI Pro for free <a class=\"superscript\" data-ga4-analytics-superscript-click=\"\" data-target=\"inline text\" href=\"#footnote-1\" id=\"footnote-source-1\" aria-label=\"Jump to link reference 1\"> <sup>1</sup> </a> (valued at $19.99/mo). This offer unlocks 4x higher usage limits in Gemini, <a class=\"superscript\" data-ga4-analytics-superscript-click=\"\" data-target=\"inline text\" href=\"#footnote-2\" id=\"footnote-source-2\" aria-label=\"Jump to link reference 2\"> <sup>2</sup> </a> access to <a href=\"https://gemini.google/overview/agent/spark/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini Spark</a>, Gemini in Google apps like Gmail and Google Docs, 5 TB of storage, Google Health Premium, <a href=\"https://support.google.com/googleone/answer/14534406?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">and more</a>.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"4k74b\">For eligible college students outside the U.S., we’re offering one year of Google AI Plus, free of charge. <a class=\"superscript\" data-ga4-analytics-superscript-click=\"\" data-target=\"inline text\" href=\"#footnote-3\" id=\"footnote-source-3\" aria-label=\"Jump to link reference 3\"> <sup>3</sup> </a> This offer provides access to Gemini Omni, 2x higher usage limits in Gemini, <a class=\"superscript\" data-ga4-analytics-superscript-click=\"\" data-target=\"inline text\" href=\"#footnote-4\" id=\"footnote-source-4\" aria-label=\"Jump to link reference 4\"> <sup>4</sup> </a> 400 GB of storage, <a href=\"https://support.google.com/googleone/answer/16882689?hl=en&amp;ref_topic=16548970&amp;sjid=14187655128156557149-NC\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">and more</a>.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"ef1p3\">Finally, for students who want ad-free music and video streaming, we’re offering a bundle of Google AI Pro and a YouTube Premium subscription for up to 70% off. <a class=\"superscript\" data-ga4-analytics-superscript-click=\"\" data-target=\"inline text\" href=\"#footnote-5\" id=\"footnote-source-5\" aria-label=\"Jump to link reference 5\"> <sup>5</sup> </a></p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"dur6q\"><a href=\"https://one.google.com/ai-student\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Claim your offer</a> today.</p>\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"5pg53\">2. Get organized with the new student hub.</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"36iq\">New in the Gemini app, we’ve built a dedicated hub <a class=\"superscript\" data-ga4-analytics-superscript-click=\"\" data-target=\"inline text\" href=\"#footnote-6\" id=\"footnote-source-6\" aria-label=\"Jump to link reference 6\"> <sup>6</sup> </a> to get you started with all of Gemini's tools and offers, just for students. The hub helps keep you organized; start a study notebook, create flashcards, take a practice quiz and more. As Gemini creates more learning tools, you’ll find them here in your student hub.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"45cnv\">Access it at <a href=\"http://gemini.google.com/students\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">gemini.google.com/students</a><b>.</b></p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n   <uni-inline-image class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\" alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Student hub rendering\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"Student hub\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_student_hub_Aug17.mp4\" section-header=\"Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us\" autoplay=\"true\">\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full \" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Inline Images&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us&quot;}\">\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n     <div class=\" uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4 \">\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <uni-video-player muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"Student hub rendering\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_student_hub_Aug17.mp4\" tts-json=\"\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us\" video-title=\"Student hub\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n        <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n        <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Student hub rendering\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" title=\"Student hub\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" poster=\"\">\n         <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_student_hub_Aug17.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_student_hub_Aug17.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n        </video>\n        <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n       </div>\n      </uni-video-player>\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n     </div>\n     <!--?-->\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n    </div>\n   </uni-inline-image>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"279qf\">3. Set up your study notebooks.</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"1uhr9\">Studying can feel overwhelming when you don’t know what to tackle first. That’s why we launched <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-app/gemini-study-notebooks/\">study notebooks</a> <a class=\"superscript\" data-ga4-analytics-superscript-click=\"\" data-target=\"inline text\" href=\"#footnote-7\" id=\"footnote-source-7\" aria-label=\"Jump to link reference 7\"> <sup>7</sup> </a> in June to guide you step-by-step through the learning process. Once you’ve uploaded your own class materials like lecture notes, Gemini sets up your study notebook with a gameplan to break down your learning topics. It gives you the option to take a diagnostic quiz to identify your unique knowledge gaps so that it can craft custom, bite-sized lessons and quizzes for you — complete with a real-time progress dashboard to track your milestones.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"45fkl\">In the coming weeks, study notebooks will be even more helpful with graphs and images as part of your lessons. And so you never miss a deadline, Gemini will even schedule your key dates (like exams and assignment due dates) in Google Calendar from your syllabus — with your permission. And with access to Google AI Plus and Google AI Pro, you can create even more notebooks with even more sources. <a href=\"https://gemini.google.com/signin?continue=https%3A%2F%2Fgemini.google.com%2Fnotebooks%2Fcreate%3Fsubtype%3Dstudy\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Get started here</a> or click “+ New notebook” in the student hub.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n   <uni-inline-image class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\" alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"New study notebooks rendering\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"Student notebooks\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_study_notebooks_Aug17.mp4.mp4\" section-header=\"Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us\" autoplay=\"true\">\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full \" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Inline Images&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us&quot;}\">\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n     <div class=\" uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4 \">\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <uni-video-player muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"New study notebooks rendering\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_study_notebooks_Aug17.mp4.mp4\" tts-json=\"\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us\" video-title=\"Student notebooks\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n        <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n        <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"New study notebooks rendering\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" title=\"Student notebooks\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" poster=\"\">\n         <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_study_notebooks_Aug17.mp4.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_study_notebooks_Aug17.mp4.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n        </video>\n        <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n       </div>\n      </uni-video-player>\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n     </div>\n     <!--?-->\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n    </div>\n   </uni-inline-image>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"279qf\">4. Dive deeper with interactive visualizations.</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"6qtji\">Prefer learning with visuals? With <a href=\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-app/3d-models-charts/\">interactive visualizations</a>, <a class=\"superscript\" data-ga4-analytics-superscript-click=\"\" data-target=\"inline text\" href=\"#footnote-8\" id=\"footnote-source-8\" aria-label=\"Jump to link reference 8\"> <sup>8</sup> </a> Gemini can generate functional 3D simulations to help you better understand the topic you’re asking about. Responses include visual elements — like tables, grids, and simulations — made specifically for your question. For example, ask about a topic that could be explained visually, like “show me how DNA works in 3D,” and you’ll be able to interactively rotate and zoom into a 3D DNA structure. Or ask to watch a pendulum trade energy back and forth, or learn about cash burn rates through an interactive table.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n   <uni-inline-image class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\" alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Interactive visualizations rendering\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"Interactive visualizations\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_interactive_visualizations_Aug19_final.mp4\" section-header=\"Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us\" autoplay=\"true\">\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full \" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Inline Images&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us&quot;}\">\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n     <div class=\" uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4 \">\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <uni-video-player muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"Interactive visualizations rendering\" autoplay=\"\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_interactive_visualizations_Aug19_final.mp4\" tts-json=\"\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us\" video-title=\"Interactive visualizations\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n        <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n        <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Interactive visualizations rendering\" class=\" uni-video-player__video uni-video-player__video--autoplay \" title=\"Interactive visualizations\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" poster=\"\">\n         <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_interactive_visualizations_Aug19_final.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_interactive_visualizations_Aug19_final.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n        </video>\n        <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n       </div>\n      </uni-video-player>\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n     </div>\n     <!--?-->\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n    </div>\n   </uni-inline-image>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <h2 data-block-key=\"279qf\">5. Talk through research with Gemini Live.</h2>\n     <p data-block-key=\"30o76\">Gemini Live provides a natural, conversational way to study — especially on the go. You can talk through your problem set or chat through materials from your Drive, and now when you want to explore a topic in more depth, Gemini Live will be ready.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"96bjn\">Rolling out today, we’re bringing the power of Deep Research into Gemini Live <a class=\"superscript\" data-ga4-analytics-superscript-click=\"\" data-target=\"inline text\" href=\"#footnote-9\" id=\"footnote-source-9\" aria-label=\"Jump to link reference 9\"> <sup>9</sup> </a> so you can launch comprehensive, multi-step research reports and chat with Gemini about them. Just ask Gemini to research a topic, then feel free to close the chat, lock your screen, or keep chatting about other things. Gemini works asynchronously in the background and sends a notification when your report is ready. Once it is, you can chat through the results, ask follow-up questions, or refine the details hands-free.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"7s9hs\">By seamlessly switching from typing to talking — while keeping the full context of your deep research report front and center — Gemini Live truly becomes the ultimate conversational study partner.</p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-inline-image-section\" data-component=\"uni-inline-image\">\n   <uni-inline-image class=\"uni-inline-image uni-inline-image--full\" alignment=\"full\" alt-text=\"Gemini Live rendering\" external-image=\"\" or-mp4-video-title=\"Gemini Live\" or-mp4-video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_GeminiLive_DR_Aug18.mp4\" section-header=\"Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us\">\n    <!---->\n    <div class=\"uni-inline-image__container uni-inline-image__container--full \" data-analytics-module=\"{&quot;module_name&quot;:&quot;Inline Images&quot;,&quot;section_header&quot;:&quot;Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us&quot;}\">\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n     <div class=\" uni-inline-image__media-asset uni-inline-image__media-asset--mp4 \">\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <uni-video-player muted playsinline=\"\" controls=\"\" type=\"video/mp4\" alt-text=\"Gemini Live rendering\" video-url=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_GeminiLive_DR_Aug18.mp4\" tts-json=\"\" audio-descripted-video=\"\" section-header=\"Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us\" video-title=\"Gemini Live\">\n       <!---->\n       <div class=\"uni-video-player\">\n        <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n        <video crossorigin=\"anonymous\" preload=\"auto\" muted playsinline=\"\" aria-label=\"Gemini Live rendering\" class=\" uni-video-player__video reduce-motion-disabled \" title=\"Gemini Live\" style=\"min-height:0px;\" poster=\"\">\n         <source type=\"video/mp4\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_GeminiLive_DR_Aug18.mp4#t=0.001\">Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos, but don't worry, you can <a download=\"\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/original_videos/16x9_GeminiLive_DR_Aug18.mp4\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">download it</a> and watch it with your favorite video player!\n        </video>\n        <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n        <div class=\" uni-video-player__controls uni-video-player__controls--unstarted \">\n         <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n         <button class=\" uni-video-player__button uni-video-player__button--main uni-video-player__button--main--active \" aria-label=\"Play video\"><uni-icon-component icon-id=\"play-arrow\"><!----></uni-icon-component></button>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </uni-video-player>\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n      <!--?-->\n     </div>\n     <!--?-->\n     <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n    </div>\n   </uni-inline-image>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page uni-grid uni-article-paragraph\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n    &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Paragraph&quot;,\n    &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Start the semester with one year of Gemini, on us&quot;\n  }\">\n   <uni-article-paragraph class=\"uni-article-paragraph__container uni-grid__col--layout-6\">\n    <div class=\"rich-text\">\n     <p data-block-key=\"279qf\">The student hub, study notebooks, interactive visualizations, and Deep Research in Gemini Live are rolling out today to all Gemini app users. Whether your goal this semester is to stay effortlessly organized, explore a new major, or ace your classes, Gemini’s here to help. It’s your personalized study buddy, grounded in all of your class materials ready to help you tackle whatever comes your way.</p>\n     <p data-block-key=\"ddqsn\">\n      <br>\n      <a href=\"https://gemini.google/students/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Explore more</a> of Gemini’s helpful learning tools, and <a href=\"https://one.google.com/ai-student?plans=1%2C2&amp;g1_landing_page=75\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">claim one year</a> of Gemini, on us.\n     </p>\n    </div>\n    <!---->\n   </uni-article-paragraph>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"uni-page\">\n   <uni-related-content-tout class=\"uni-related-content-tout uni-grid uni-component-spacing\" title=\"Back to School 2026\" cta=\"See more\" summary=\"How Google tools can help students and educators this back-to-school season.\" hideimage=\"False\" eyebrow=\"Collection\" image-alt-text=\"\" fullurl=\"https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/back-to-school-2026/\" pagetype=\"collectiondetailpage\" imageurl=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/BTSBundleCollection_social.width-800.format-webp.webp\" data-analytics-module=\"{\n      &quot;module_name&quot;: &quot;Related Content Tout&quot;,\n      &quot;section_header&quot;: &quot;Back to School 2026&quot;\n    }\" data-theme-color=\"neutral\">\n    <!---->\n    <section class=\"uni-related-content-tout uni-related-content-tout__container uni-grid__col--span-4 uni-grid__col--span-12-tablet uni-grid__col--start-1-tablet uni-grid__col--span-8-desktop uni-grid__col--start-3-desktop\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"tout-title\">\n     <div class=\"uni-related-content-tout__content\">\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <p class=\"uni-related-content-tout__eyebrow font-eyebrow\"><!--?lit$656963292$-->Collection</p>\n      <h2 id=\"tout-title\" class=\"uni-related-content-tout__title font-h4\"><!--?lit$656963292$-->Back to School 2026</h2>\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <div class=\"uni-related-content-tout__summary font-body-s\">\n       <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n       How Google tools can help students and educators this back-to-school season.\n      </div>\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <div class=\"uni-related-content-tout__cta-container\">\n       <uni-cta emphasis=\"low\" icon-id-right=\"arrow-forward\" role=\"presentation\"><!----><a role=\"button\" aria-label=\"See more\" href=\"https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/education/back-to-school-2026/\" class=\"uni-cta  uni-cta--low-emphasis \"><!--?lit$656963292$--><!--?lit$656963292$--> <!--?lit$656963292$--><span class=\" font-ctas uni-cta__label uni-cta__label--r-spacer \"><!--?lit$656963292$--><!----><!--?lit$656963292$--><!----><!---->See more<!----></span> <!--?lit$656963292$--> \n         <div class=\"uni-cta__icon-container\">\n          <uni-icon-component custom-class=\"uni-cta__icon\" icon-id=\"arrow-forward\"><!----></uni-icon-component>\n         </div> \n         <!--?--></a></uni-cta>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"uni-related-content-tout__image-container\">\n      <!--?lit$656963292$-->\n      <img class=\"uni-related-content-tout__image\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-uniblog-publish-prod/images/BTSBundleCollection_social.width-800.format-webp.webp\" alt=\"Back to School 2026\">\n     </div>\n    </section>\n   </uni-related-content-tout>\n  </section>\n </body>\n</html>",
